UNRELEASED
==========
* Authorize proxy tickets per browser session via
  ``ProxyGrantingTicket.allow_service`` and the new ``SessionServiceGrant``
  model; ``retrieve_pt`` only delegates to services granted to the current
  session.
* Never deliver a proxy ticket to a session that a single logout terminated,
  including when the CAS answer arrives after the logout.
* Split proxy failures into retryable ``ProxyError`` (transport) and
  non-retryable ``ProxyDenied`` (ineligibility) exceptions.

5.1.2 (2026-10-28)
==================
* Updated homepage and doc links
* Update docs to encourage minimum version Django 5.2.
* Validate the login ``next`` parameter when ``CAS_LOGIN_NEXT_PAGE`` is unset.
* Don't update groups via attribute with CAS_APPLY_ATTRIBUTES_TO_USER.

5.1.1 (2026-05-05)
==================
* Fixed bug where it was possible for CAS_APPLY_ATTRIBUTES_TO_USER to
  interfere with the username.
* Support POST logout requests
* Add support for Django 5.2.
* Add CAS_STAFF_AFFILIATION setting
* Refactored clean_sessions()
